/* Maxima is authoritative for the exact linear flow expm(A*dt) used by chc.splitting.
   Oscillator A = [[0,1],[-1,-1/5]], dt = 1/10; compared against jax.scipy.linalg.expm (float64). */

load("diag")$
A : matrix([0, 1], [-1, -1/5])$
dt : 1/10$
E : mat_function(exp, A*dt)$
Ereal : ratsimp(realpart(rectform(E)))$   /* complex eigenpair -> real matrix */
fpprec : 30$
print("expm(A*dt) real (30 digits) =", bfloat(Ereal))$
